Operator: lean into energy models that AUGMENT the leaderboard winners' approaches. The strategic
through-line: the field's wall is generalization (all winners <13%; their CNN/value models memorize
per-game -- and WE hit the same wall, discriminative LOO=0.503=chance). The move no pure-RL/CNN team
has made = OBJECTIVE energy over GAME-AGNOSTIC structure, the candidate that transfers where
learned-from-success value cannot. Three grafts (frame-change->energy-progress, value->contrastive
energy, world-model->trust energy), GATED on GAP-ARCH-FEATURES (.414 A2: structural features so
energy can transfer -- energy over current frame-marginals is no better than their CNN; prove LOO>0.6,
don't assume). Reframes the queued frame-change + trust-energy specs as the energy-augmented hybrid.

